  "description": "I only called to complain about the issue with my product… Yeong-Ha fell in love with the voice of the customer service operator. What if the man with that same voice appears in front of Yeong-Ha?! Yeong-Ha had just found the voice of his dreams. Eun-Seong, a man with a perfect and dreamy voice, who'd rather devote himself to work than be in a relationship. Seon-Nam, owner of the adult shop, \"Adult Angel.\" Seon-Su, Yeong-Ha's first crush and judo athlete! A romantic love square between the three men and Yeong-Ha! \n\n(Source: Wutopia Comics, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes nine extra chapters.*",
